+## S4_2 Additions
+
+### New Classes
+
+```
+SQLAlchemyTask (app/models/sqlalchemy_task.py)
+  - id: int (primary key, autoincrement)
+  - title: str (NOT NULL)
+  - description: str (nullable)
+  - completed: bool (NOT NULL, default False)
+
+UIBlueprint (app/routes/ui.py)
+  uses: TaskService (via current_app.task_service)
+  routes: /, /tasks/new, /tasks, /tasks/<id>/complete, /tasks/<id>/delete
+```
